#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Run the dynamics simulation {#2-run-the-dynamics-simulation}"
msgstr "2. Jalankan simulasi dinamika {#2-run-the-dynamics-simulation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Submit the problem through the Qiskit Function. The Qiskit Functions Catalog handles IBM Quantum authentication, so you don't pass separate Fire Opal or hardware-provider credentials to `sim_qf.run()`.\n"
msgstr "Kirim masalahnya lewat Qiskit Function. Qiskit Functions Catalog menangani autentikasi IBM Quantum, jadi kamu tidak perlu memberikan kredensial Fire Opal atau penyedia hardware terpisah ke `sim_qf.run()`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The returned object is a Qiskit Function job. You can keep the job ID to retrieve or inspect the workload later.\n"
msgstr "Objek yang dikembalikan adalah job Qiskit Function. Kamu bisa menyimpan ID job untuk mengambil atau memeriksa beban kerja tersebut nanti.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Retrieve the result {#3-retrieve-the-result}"
msgstr "3. Ambil hasilnya {#3-retrieve-the-result}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Convert the observable expectation values to a NumPy array. Each row corresponds to one observable, and each column corresponds to a recorded simulation time, beginning at $t=0$. For this example, the four rows contain the spin-up occupations of sites 0 through 3.\n"
msgstr "Ubah nilai ekspektasi observable menjadi array NumPy. Setiap baris sesuai dengan satu observable, dan setiap kolom sesuai dengan waktu simulasi yang tercatat, dimulai dari $t=0$. Untuk contoh ini, keempat baris berisi okupansi spin-up dari site 0 sampai 3.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "4. Visualize the dynamics {#4-visualize-the-dynamics}"
msgstr "4. Visualisasikan dinamikanya {#4-visualize-the-dynamics}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The initial state contains one spin-up fermion and no spin-down fermions. Its evolution therefore remains in the single-particle subspace, whose four basis states correspond to the fermion occupying sites 0, 1, 2, and 3.\n"
msgstr "Keadaan awal berisi satu fermion spin-up dan tidak ada fermion spin-down. Karena itu evolusinya tetap berada di subruang satu-partikel, yang keempat keadaan basis-nya sesuai dengan fermion yang menempati site 0, 1, 2, dan 3.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this subspace, the Hamiltonian connects neighboring sites with hopping amplitude $-t_h$. For the parameters used here,\n"
msgstr "Dalam subruang ini, Hamiltonian menghubungkan site-site bertetangga dengan amplitudo hopping $-t_h$. Untuk parameter yang dipakai di sini,\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"H_{\\mathrm{1p}}\n"
"=\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"H_{\\mathrm{1p}}\n"
"=\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"-t_h\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"0 & 0 & 1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"-t_h\n"
"\\begin{pmatrix}\n"
"0 & 1 & 0 & 0 \\\\\n"
"1 & 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\\n"
"0 & 1 & 0 & 1 \\\\\n"
"0 & 0 & 1 & 0\n"
"\\end{pmatrix}.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Diagonalize this matrix with NumPy and evolve the initial state at the same times that were returned by the Dynamics Simulator. The squared magnitude of each state amplitude gives the spin-up occupation of the corresponding site.\n"
msgstr "Diagonalkan matriks ini dengan NumPy lalu evolusikan state awal pada waktu-waktu yang sama dengan yang dikembalikan oleh Dynamics Simulator. Kuadrat magnitudo setiap amplitudo state memberikan okupansi spin-up dari site yang bersangkutan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This calculation gives exact Hamiltonian evolution. Differences between the hardware estimates and this reference can include the finite Trotter step, measurement statistics, and residual hardware errors.\n"
msgstr "Perhitungan ini memberikan evolusi Hamiltonian yang eksak. Perbedaan antara estimasi hardware dan acuan ini bisa berasal dari Trotter step yang terbatas, statistik pengukuran, dan error hardware yang tersisa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Plot one panel for each site. The solid curves show the exact reference at the recorded times, and the markers show the hardware estimates returned by the Dynamics Simulator.\n"
msgstr "Buat satu panel untuk setiap site. Kurva solid menunjukkan acuan eksak pada waktu-waktu yang tercatat, dan marker menunjukkan estimasi hardware yang dikembalikan oleh Dynamics Simulator.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/q-ctrl-dynamics-simulator/extracted-outputs/61a7ad6e-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/q-ctrl-dynamics-simulator/extracted-outputs/61a7ad6e-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "At $t=0$, the exact spin-up occupation is 1 at site 0 and 0 at the other sites. As the system evolves, hopping spreads the particle's probability across the chain. The occupation of site 1 increases first, followed by increasing occupation at sites 2 and 3. For the parameters in this example, the final recorded time is $t=1.6$. The exact occupations of sites 0 through 3 are approximately 0.026, 0.370, 0.392, and 0.211, respectively.\n"
msgstr "Pada $t=0$, okupansi spin-up yang eksak adalah 1 di site 0 dan 0 di site lainnya. Seiring sistem berevolusi, hopping menyebarkan probabilitas partikel ke seluruh rantai. Okupansi site 1 naik lebih dulu, disusul okupansi site 2 dan 3 yang ikut naik. Untuk parameter dalam contoh ini, waktu terakhir yang tercatat adalah $t=1.6$. Okupansi eksak site 0 sampai 3 masing-masing kira-kira 0.026, 0.370, 0.392, dan 0.211.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exact occupations satisfy the following equation at every time, reflecting conservation of particle number:\n"
msgstr "Okupansi eksak memenuhi persamaan berikut pada setiap waktu, yang mencerminkan kekekalan jumlah partikel:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{i=0}^{3}\\langle n_{i\\uparrow}(t)\\rangle=1\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\sum_{i=0}^{3}\\langle n_{i\\uparrow}(t)\\rangle=1\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Individual site occupations can rise and fall as the particle evolves through the finite chain.\n"
msgstr "Okupansi tiap site bisa naik dan turun saat partikel berevolusi di sepanjang rantai yang terbatas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Fetch error messages {#fetch-error-messages}"
msgstr "Ambil pesan error {#fetch-error-messages}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the workload enters the `ERROR` state, call `job.result()` to retrieve the error message. You can also inspect the function logs, if they are available.\n"
msgstr "Kalau workload masuk ke state `ERROR`, panggil `job.result()` untuk mengambil pesan error-nya. Kamu juga bisa memeriksa log fungsi, kalau tersedia.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Common input-validation issues include an unsupported model or simulation method, an initial-state string that is too long, mismatched observable terms and coefficients, or an observable that references a site outside the initial-state string.\n"
msgstr "Masalah validasi input yang umum antara lain model atau metode simulasi yang tidak didukung, string initial state yang terlalu panjang, suku observable dan koefisien yang tidak cocok, atau observable yang merujuk ke site di luar string initial state.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get support {#get-support}"
msgstr "Dapatkan bantuan {#get-support}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
