msgstr "Untuk pertanyaan soal perilaku Dynamics Simulator atau Fire Opal, lihat [dokumentasi Q-CTRL](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/) atau [hubungi Q-CTRL](https://form.typeform.com/to/iuujEAEI).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For Qiskit Functions authentication, job management, or IBM Quantum Platform access, see the [Qiskit Functions documentation](/guides/functions).\n"
msgstr "Untuk autentikasi Qiskit Functions, manajemen job, atau akses IBM Quantum Platform, lihat [dokumentasi Qiskit Functions](/guides/functions).\n"

