msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Review the [`simulate_dynamics` API reference](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/references/fire-opal/fireopal/fireopal.simulate_dynamics) for the underlying model, simulation, observable, output, and validation definitions.\n"
"- Try the [Spin and charge dynamics in the Fermi-Hubbard model](/tutorials/fermi-hubbard-spin-charge-dynamics) tutorial.\n"
"- Read the [Fire Opal dynamics simulator overview](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/fire-opal/execute/run-algorithms/fire-opal-dynamics-simulator) for more detail about Trotterization, hardware-aware mapping, and Fire Opal error suppression.\n"
"- Modify the model parameters, initial state, time step, step count, and observables to study a different one-dimensional Fermi-Hubbard dynamics problem.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- Tinjau [referensi API `simulate_dynamics`](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/references/fire-opal/fireopal/fireopal.simulate_dynamics) untuk definisi model, simulasi, observable, output, dan validasi yang mendasarinya.\n"
"- Coba tutorial [Dinamika spin dan muatan dalam model Fermi-Hubbard](/tutorials/fermi-hubbard-spin-charge-dynamics).\n"
"- Baca [ikhtisar Fire Opal dynamics simulator](https://docs.q-ctrl.com/fire-opal/execute/run-algorithms/fire-opal-dynamics-simulator) untuk detail lebih lanjut tentang Trotterization, pemetaan yang sadar hardware, dan penekanan error Fire Opal.\n"
"- Ubah parameter model, initial state, time step, jumlah step, dan observable untuk mempelajari masalah dinamika Fermi-Hubbard satu dimensi yang berbeda.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
